{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649940/extras/Demo.png?t=1745890781\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this demo, you will take your first steps inside the treacherous Labyrinth. Players will get a feel for the game through the starting area of the game, culminating in a challenging battle with Zobor's Remnant, the first guardian of the Labyrinth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649940/extras/Breaker_v2.png?t=1745890781\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649940/extras/Blood-Pounding_Combat_LATEST.png?t=1745890781\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in fast, responsive combat that encourages players to chain attack combos, dodges and unleash powerful abilities to defeat enemies. Using the Blood Ascension System, upgrade Ayana's stats, unlock new abilities, and refine her combat skills to aid her survival in the Labyrinth</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649940/extras/Combat.png?t=1745890781\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649940/extras/Breaker_v2.png?t=1745890781\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649940/extras/A_Dangerous_Journey_LATEST.png?t=1745890781\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enemies are not the only dangers in the Labyrinth. Ayana will have to navigate deadly traps and platforming challenges that will put your timing, precision, and reflexes to the test</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649940/extras/Platforming.png?t=1745890781\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649940/extras/Breaker_v2.png?t=1745890781\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649940/extras/Devour_your_Foes_LATEST.png?t=1745890781\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Harness Ayana's vampiric abilities by consuming weakened enemies to restore Blood Points. Ayana can use these points to heal herself and keep the fight going</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649940/extras/Devour.png?t=1745890781\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649940/extras/Breaker_v2.png?t=1745890781\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3649940?t=1745890781","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3649940?t=1745890781","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649940/382d31c0b389b68ce135fbbb6b6112675535d7e9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745890781","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649940/382d31c0b389b68ce135fbbb6b6112675535d7e9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745890781","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649940/extras/Demo.png?t=1745890781\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this demo, you will take your first steps inside the treacherous Labyrinth. Players will get a feel for the game through the starting area of the game, culminating in a challenging battle with Zobor's Remnant, the first guardian of the Labyrinth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649940/extras/Breaker_v2.png?t=1745890781\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649940/extras/Blood-Pounding_Combat_LATEST.png?t=1745890781\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in fast, responsive combat that encourages players to chain attack combos, dodges and unleash powerful abilities to defeat enemies. Using the Blood Ascension System, upgrade Ayana's stats, unlock new abilities, and refine her combat skills to aid her survival in the Labyrinth</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649940/extras/Combat.png?t=1745890781\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649940/extras/Breaker_v2.png?t=1745890781\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649940/extras/A_Dangerous_Journey_LATEST.png?t=1745890781\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enemies are not the only dangers in the Labyrinth. Ayana will have to navigate deadly traps and platforming challenges that will put your timing, precision, and reflexes to the test</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649940/extras/Platforming.png?t=1745890781\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649940/extras/Breaker_v2.png?t=1745890781\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649940/extras/Devour_your_Foes_LATEST.png?t=1745890781\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Harness Ayana's vampiric abilities by consuming weakened enemies to restore Blood Points. Ayana can use these points to heal herself and keep the fight going</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649940/extras/Devour.png?t=1745890781\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649940/extras/Breaker_v2.png?t=1745890781\" /></p>","developers":["Phoenix Up! Media"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3530380","name":"Bloodbreaker: Labyrinth of the Witch"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649940/89a57724180adeaac8486a069c7e5c3cc5233492/header.jpg?t=1745890781","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257128617,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257128617/movie480.mp4?t=1745813850","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257128617/movie_max.mp4?t=1745813850"},"name":"Bloodbreaker: Labyrinth of the Witch Demo Teaser Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257128617/e7885addb0c74449d457d09d80f13f071427356d/movie_600x337.jp